'''Sleeping Chasm''' (眠りの深淵 ''Nemuri no Shin'en'', '''Abyss of Sleep''') is the 24th sub-chapter of [[Zero Legends]], and the 122nd sub-chapter overall. It was introduced in [[Version 14.7 Update|Version 14.7]] and is available up to {{1c}} difficulty.

==Difficulty==
While Sleeping Chasm's difficulty is generally higher compared to the previous few Zero Legends sub-chapters, most of the stages here are still fairly uncomplicated and are solved with simple techniques. The only stage that could potentially take more than one try would be [[Dozing Love]], which features the return of [[Codename "Red Riding"]] supported by a 200% [[Cosmic Cyclone]].

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces 1 new enemy:
*[[Darkmadillo]]: A [[:Category:Dark Enemies|Dark]] Long Distance attacker that strikes units within 200~500 every ~5 seconds while standing from 250 range. Unusually for a Dark enemy, it only has 2 knockbacks and 10 speed.

