==Trivia==
*The "Dreams" in [[Dreams and Illusions]] could be a reference to [[Youcan]], as his Japanese name (大夢くん ''Ōmu-kun'') contains the kanji for dream (夢) and his Japanese description says his parents gave him this name because they wanted him to have a big dream about his future.
*The "Love" in [[Dozing Love]] is likely a reference to [[Learned to Love]], as both stages contain [[Codename "Red Riding"]]. Their names are closer in [[BCJP]], with Dozing Love being Nemuritate no Ai (眠りたての愛, "Freshly Asleep Love") and Learned to Love being Oboetate no Ai (おぼたての愛, "Freshly Learned Love" or "Freshly Remembered Love").

